# Normalize text files to LF in the repository. Explicit eol rules below keep
# executable scripts checkout-consistent across platforms without forcing a
# working-tree renormalization: POSIX shell and JavaScript sources stay LF
# everywhere, PowerShell sources get CRLF (their native convention).
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
